31 A1 00 12 E0 00 11 E0 FD 00 FF

### This is an example in plaintext, if you want runnable examples check ../raw-elal ###

### Explanation:
31A1: Header
00: Separator
12 E0: Take user input and put it in E0
00: Separator
11 E0 FD: Print E0 and tell print E0 is a variable and not an ASCII char using FD
00: Separator
FF: EOF
